,"color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":40,"divider":false,"narrow":false,"rounded":false}},"portfolio_khhjiy":{"type":"portfolio","blocks":{"profile_FtXEVP":{"type":"profile","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Screenshot_2025-06-04_at_11.53.51_AM.png","heading":"Scallop Crudo with Watermelon","text":"<p>Meticulously cut yellowtail and watermelon with thinly sliced Peruvian scallops for a touch of luxury. The dish is finished with a spritz of citrus ponzu and a sprinkle of homemade seasoning, making it a true masterpiece on the plate.<\/p><p>👉🏽 <a href=\"https:\/\/seatopia.fish\/blogs\/seafood-recipes\/kingfish-and-scallop-crudo-with-watermelon\" target=\"_blank\">Get the Recipe<\/a><\/p>","color_text":"#ffffff","color_background":"#171717"}},"profile_9abkc4":{"type":"profile","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/seacorp-peruvian-scallop-meat-20-oz-175608.png","heading":"Scallops with Romesco","text":"<p>A super easy light starter to counter the heavy mains of a big dinner. It’s a cold starter (apart from the cooking of the scallops) so the preparation of this dish can be done in advance. There’s a lot of late season tomatoes knocking around in grocery stores. Heritage tomatoes have more bite and texture which works perfect for this dish. <\/p><p>👉🏽 <a href=\"https:\/\/seatopia.fish\/blogs\/seafood-recipes\/scallops-with-romesco-and-marinated-tomatoes\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/seatopia.fish\/blogs\/seafood-recipes\/scallops-with-romesco-and-marinated-tomatoes\">Get the recipe<\/a><\/p>","color_text":"#ffffff","color_background":"#171717"}},"profile_tPnk6G":{"type":"profile","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Screenshot_2025-06-04_at_11.56.56_AM.png","heading":"Scallop Crudo with Citrus Soy","text":"<p>Rich in omega-3 fatty acids crucial for optimal brain function and carefully lab-tested to ensure they're mercury-safe and free from detectable microplastics, these scallops offer gourmet indulgence paired with peace of mind.<\/p><p>👉🏽 <a href=\"https:\/\/seatopia.fish\/blogs\/seafood-recipes\/asian-scallop-crudo-with-citrus-soy-marinade\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/seatopia.fish\/blogs\/seafood-recipes\/asian-scallop-crudo-with-citrus-soy-marinade\">Get the recipe<\/a><\/p>","color_text":"#ffffff","color_background":"#171717"}}},"block_order":["profile_FtXEVP","profile_9abkc4","profile_tPnk6G"],"custom_css":["\/* Center the tiles inside the grid *\/.portfolio.card-grid {display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 2rem; padding: 1rem; text-align: center;}"," \/* Optional: center the parent container if needed *\/.card-grid--4 {justify-content: center;}",".grid {justify-content: center;}",".profile.card {max-width: clamp(250px, 25vw, 300px); width: 100%;}"],"settings":{"columns":4,"carousel_on_desktop":false,"layout":"default","image_ratio":"portrait","image_ratio_mobile":"portrait","columns_mobile":"1","swipe_on_mobile":true,"heading":"Seacorp Peruvian Scallop Recipes","heading_size":"title-md","heading_alignment":"text-center justify-center","heading_tag":"h2","subheading":"","description":"","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":60,"padding_bottom":60,"divider":false,"full_width":false,"rounded":false}},"map_LW4PtC":{"type":"map","settings":{"transparent_header":false,"map_address":"Sechura Bay, Peru","map_api_key":"AIzaSyB_I3DlYvmrlYUbo8fKz9ABuxCbZN5PCLY","map_zoom":12,"map_style":"silver","image_height":"650px","content_position":"md:items-end md:justify-start","text_alignment":"left","content_position_mobile":"image_first","image_height_mobile":"400px","text_alignment_mobile":"left","color_